# Raw downloads are large and redistributable only from their original sources;
# the manifest in PROVENANCE.md records where they come from.
data/raw/

# Cached feature matrices can be regenerated from the raw data and the loaders.
# They are large, so they stay out of the repo; delete data/features to rebuild.
data/features/

